{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down action RPG, you'll step into the cursed, purple-misted wasteland as the last scion of the Holy Order. Wield dynamic skill combos to battle twisted knights and animated monstrosities. Craft your unique combat style through an in-depth talent tree and equipment affix system - will you become a paladin whose auras shield allies, or a destroyer breathing dragonfire? Trade supplies at campfires, solve mechanism puzzles, and uncover the ancient truth behind the comet catastrophe. Every choice you make will determine whether humanity's last spark can welcome the dawn that purifies the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the fun of grinding maps and challenge all kinds of monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has set up multiple map levels, and each map level corresponds to different monsters and skill playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/918f9d2c545cce1b98c0f04a868b3830.avif?t=1773643280\" width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/918f9d2c545cce1b98c0f04a868b3830.avif?t=1773643280\" width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/611c8ffd7005ffbad49cb2897f2545fd.avif?t=1773643280\" width=1560 height=855 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598020/extras/0c2e780a63d51f2e860d80ecb674f7f5.avif?t=1773643280\" width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><p class=\"b